        <div class="language-panel" data-language="en">
          <h2>Literature search and review</h2>
          <div class="hypothesis-pair">
            <article><h3>Literature search</h3><p>Identifies the relevant literature.</p></article>
            <article><h3>Literature review</h3><p>Reviews the literature selected.</p></article>
          </div>
          <p class="lead small-lead">Creswell (2012) suggests identifying key terms, locating literature, critically examining sources for relevance, topicality, accuracy, scope and coverage, organising the literature, and then writing the review.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="language-panel" data-language="zh" hidden lang="zh-Hant">
          <h2>文獻檢索與文獻綜述</h2>
          <div class="hypothesis-pair">
            <article><h3>文獻檢索</h3><p>識別相關文獻。</p></article>
            <article><h3>文獻綜述</h3><p>回顧所選文獻。</p></article>
          </div>
          <p class="lead small-lead">Creswell（2012）建議先確定關鍵詞、查找文獻，再從相關性、時效性、準確性、範圍與覆蓋面批判檢視來源，組織文獻，然後撰寫文獻綜述。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="slide" data-title="Activity 6: Search with keywords" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="slide-inner">
        <header class="slide-header"><span class="eyebrow">Activity 6: Search with keywords</span><button class="translate-button" type="button" aria-pressed="false">中文</button></header>
        <div class="language-panel" data-language="en">
          <h2>Steps to keywords</h2>
          <ol class="keyword-steps">
            <li><strong>Extract key concepts</strong><span>Nouns from research questions, e.g., social media, employability, language learning.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Brainstorm keywords</strong><span>Synonyms, variants, and broader/narrower terms for each concept.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Use phrase searching</strong><span>Quotation marks for exact phrases to improve precision.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Filter results</strong><span>Publication year, document type, language, etc.</span></li>
          </ol>
          <div class="operator-line"><code>“…”</code><span>reduce returned sites</span><code>teach*</code><span>teach, teaching, teacher</span><code>~English teaching</code><span>English language, English teaching</span><code>AND · NOT · OR</code></div>
        </div>
        <div class="language-panel" data-language="zh" hidden lang="zh-Hant">
          <h2>從研究問題到關鍵詞</h2>
          <ol class="keyword-steps">
            <li><strong>提取關鍵概念</strong><span>從研究問題提取名詞，例如社交媒體、就業能力、語言學習。</span></li>
            <li><strong>構思關鍵詞</strong><span>為每個概念生成同義詞、變體、更廣與更窄的詞語。</span></li>
            <li><strong>使用短語檢索</strong><span>以引號搜尋精確短語，提高準確度。</span></li>
            <li><strong>篩選結果</strong><span>按出版年份、文件類型、語言等篩選。</span></li>
          </ol>
          <div class="operator-line"><code>“…”</code><span>減少返回結果</span><code>teach*</code><span>teach、teaching、teacher</span><code>~English teaching</code><span>English language、English teaching</span><code>AND · NOT · OR</code></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

